    "prompt": "Given a string in which words are separated by spaces, return the first word that is repeated somewhere in the string.",
    "source_code": "#include <iostream>\n#include <string>\n#include <sstream>\nusing namespace std;\n\n/**\n   Returns the index of the first occurrence of t in s, \n   or -1 if t doesn't occur in s.\n*/\nint find(string s, string t)\n{   \n   for (int i = 0; i + t.length() <= s.length(); i++)\n   {\n      if (s.substr(i, t.length()) == t)\n      {\n         return i;\n      }\n   }\n   return -1;\n}\n\nstring firstRepeatedSomewhere(string s)\n{\n\n\n\n}"
